I took Carl Johnson's (carl@mugwump.UK.Sun.COM) monochrome fix, turned
the fix into a command-line option, and saved the changes into a
patchfile.  With this patch, you can run jetpack in color or monochrome
(with the -mono switch).  The jetpack manual page is also updated to
reflect the change.  This patch is nothing extraordinary, but it will
allow you to play on a monochrome system.

This patch, along with Daniel Ketcham's (dan@netlabs.com), make jetpack
quite playable (maybe a little too playable? ;-) ) on a Sun Sparc ELC.

Enjoy!

Bryan


